{"step_index":1198,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T11:33:28Z","content":"Good, I have a full picture of the codebase. Now let me build the implementation plan.","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":true,\"Summary\":\"Full implementation plan to make SmartAGENT agentic: adds a ReAct reasoning loop (Thought → Action → Observation), 8 security-focused tools (read_file, scan_code, search_code, analyze_security, etc.), conversation memory with sliding window, interactive CLI chat mode, and one-shot agent command. All running locally on GTX 1650 with 4-bit quantization, no Ollama.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Make SmartAGENT Fully Agentic\\n\\nTransform SmartAGENT from a **static scanner with AI verification** into a **fully autonomous agentic security AI** that can think, plan, use tools, and act on its own.\\n\\n## What Changes\\n\\n**Before:** You run `smartagent scan .` → static regex patterns find issues → optionally asks the LLM to verify each one.\\n\\n**After:** You chat with SmartAGENT like a real security engineer:\\n```\\nYou: scan this project for vulnerabilities\\nAgent: [Thought] I'll start by listing all files in the project...\\n       [Action] list_files → found 47 files\\n       [Thought] Let me read the main app.py first...\\n       [Action] read_file app.py → found SQL query on line 34\\n       [Thought] This uses f-string interpolation in a SQL query — CWE-89...\\n       [Action] scan_code → CRITICAL: SQL Injection\\n       [Thought] Let me check if there's input sanitization upstream...\\n       [Action] read_file utils.py → no sanitization found\\n       [Answer] Found 3 vulnerabilities. Here's the full report...\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Architecture\\n\\n```\\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│              Interactive CLI (Rich)           │\\n│         smartagent chat / smartagent scan     │\\n└──────────────────┬───────────────────────────┘\\n                   │\\n┌──────────────────▼───────────────────────────┐\\n│           ReAct Agent Loop (core.py)          │\\n│   Thought → Action → Observation → Repeat    │\\n│         Powered by Fluxnat Coder 3B           │\\n└──────────┬───────────────────┬───────────────┘\\n           │                   │\\n┌──────────▼\n<truncated 6062 bytes>","Description":"\"Full implementation plan to transform SmartAGENT from a static scanner into an agentic security AI with ReAct reasoning loop, tool use, memory, interactive CLI chat, and autonomous code analysis capabilities.\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\k4ran\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\e2c1cf9f-2dff-4bf4-a974-ef410441acfa\\\\implementation_plan.md\"","toolAction":"\"Creating implementation plan\"","toolSummary":"\"Agentic architecture plan\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
